      "text": "To edit a privileged credential:"
    },
    {
      "item": "From the navigation menu, go to Zero Trust Browser > Credentials Management > Privileged Credentials > Managed.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          32,
          50
        ],
        [
          53,
          75
        ],
        [
          78,
          100
        ],
        [
          103,
          111
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the table, locate the privileged credential you want to modify and click the Edit icon.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          80,
          84
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Edit Credential window appears.",
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Edit Credential window, modify fields as necessary. To learn more about each field, see Configuring Privileged Credentials.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          22
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You cannot change the Credential Type setting.",
      "strong": [
        [
          22,
          37
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To learn more about Privileged Remote Access (PRA), see Understanding Privileged Remote Access. To set up PRA, see Step-by-Step Configuration Guide for Privileged Remote Access."
